      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 6.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.43,
      "end_seconds": 15.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.87,
      "end_seconds": 24.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Well, I've been having sudden severe pain on the right side of my pelvis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.22,
      "end_seconds": 27.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.53,
      "end_seconds": 31.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "probably two days. Yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.74,
      "end_seconds": 40.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.54,
      "end_seconds": 52.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.24,
      "text": "It just comes and goes. Yes, movement. That makes it worse. Oh, and pain that comes in waves."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.97,
      "end_seconds": 57.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.34,
      "end_seconds": 61.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.57,
      "end_seconds": 66.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "I follow. A few quick ones: fever, vaginal bleeding or missed period?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.45,
      "end_seconds": 74.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.17,
      "end_seconds": 77.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.17,
      "end_seconds": 81.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Okay, so no problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.29,
      "end_seconds": 85.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "okay, any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.99,
      "end_seconds": 88.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.07,
      "end_seconds": 107.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.57,
      "end_seconds": 110.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.7,
      "end_seconds": 128.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.9,
      "end_seconds": 133.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.84,
      "end_seconds": 137.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.31,
      "end_seconds": 142.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.45,
      "end_seconds": 146.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.97,
      "end_seconds": 152.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.39,
      "end_seconds": 156.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.55,
      "end_seconds": 159.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.44,
      "end_seconds": 179.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.15,
      "end_seconds": 193.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.09,
      "end_seconds": 224.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 129 over 78, saturation 97 percent, temp 36.6 degrees, pulse is 104 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.7,
      "end_seconds": 228.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.49,
      "end_seconds": 232.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.56,
      "end_seconds": 252.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "You are in severe pain with a tender mass low on the right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.16,
      "end_seconds": 257.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.64,
      "end_seconds": 276.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I don't have a clear answer today: possible ovarian torsion is possible, and so is appendicitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.19,
      "end_seconds": 278.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.78,
      "end_seconds": 305.69,
      "duration_seconds": 23.91,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible ovarian torsion, and we'll know more once the a pregnancy test is back. I think a pregnancy test makes sense here, for pelvic pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.13,
      "end_seconds": 309.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "oh, is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.87,
      "end_seconds": 319.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "you need an emergency scan and probably surgery today i'll also refer you to the gynaecology team"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.71,
      "end_seconds": 322.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "alright, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.7,
      "end_seconds": 333.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.98,
      "end_seconds": 338.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Well, okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.45,
      "end_seconds": 341.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "come back straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.11,
      "end_seconds": 345.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.96,
      "end_seconds": 351.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.46,
      "end_seconds": 356.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
